    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6442d975ad54813badc1ddf7/JIAN8B1dLOXN8fWTk8_mI.jpeg) ⟨28⟩\nAdithyaSK⟨28⟩\n/\ndata_agent_rl_environment_train_multireward⟨29⟩\nlike 1\nLanguages:  English ⟨30⟩\nSize:  1K<n<10K ⟨31⟩\nTags:  reinforcement-learning ⟨32⟩ data-science ⟨33⟩ code-agent ⟨34⟩ jupyter ⟨35⟩ harbor ⟨36⟩ training-data ⟨37⟩ + 1\nLicense:\napache-2.0\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨38⟩ Community ⟨39⟩\nDataset Viewer\nThe dataset viewer is not available because its heuristics could not detect any supported data files⟨40⟩. You can try uploading⟨41⟩ some data files, or configuring⟨42⟩ the data files location manually.\n#   ⟨43⟩ AdithyaSK/data_agent_rl_environment_train_multireward \nMulti-reward variant of `AdithyaSK/data_agent_rl_environment_train`⟨44⟩ (2238 tasks, identical data/instructions). The **only** change: each task's verifier now emits a **`reward.json`**with three named rewards instead of a single float:  \n| reward  | meaning  | range  |  \n| --- | --- | --- |  \n| `correctness`  | graded answer matches gold (exact / numeric / LLM-judge)  | 0 or 1  |  \n| `submission`  | a non-empty answer was written to `/workdir/answer.txt`  | 0 or 1  |  \n| `tool_efficiency`  | fewer agent tool calls -> higher; `clip(1 - n_calls/TOOL_BUDGET, 0, 1)`  | 0..1 or null  |  \n  * If nothing is submitted, all three are `0`.\n  * `tool_efficiency` is a **raw** signal (not gated on correctness) — the RL reward combiner decides gating/weights. It's `null` if the harness didn't report a tool-call count.\n  * Tool-call count is read from `/workdir/.n_tool_calls` (written by the harness) or the `N_TOOL_CALLS` env var. `TOOL_BUDGET` defaults to 15.\n\n\nHarbor natively carries named rewards (`VerifierResult.rewards: dict[str,float]`), reading `/logs/verifier/reward.json`.\nBuilt for GRPO RL on the data-agent bash environment (see the parent dataset for provenance).\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    2,609\nTotal file size: 35.9 MB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨45⟩ Privacy⟨46⟩ About⟨47⟩ Careers⟨48⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
